                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>Well done, Methylnaltrexone is an opioid antagonist that is specifically given to decrease the constipating effects of opioids.&nbsp;</div>\n",
                    "notChosenFeedback": "<div>You should have chosen this answer because Methylnaltrexone is an opioid antagonist that is specifically given to decrease the constipating effects of opioids.</div>\n",
