                  "text": "<div>Methylnaltrexone</div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": false,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>Morphine</div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>Yes, Naloxone is the general opioid antagonist that is used for overdose of opioids.&nbsp;</div>\n",
